OL,4,BFerguson targets PGA Tour after injury 
OL,5,Bwoes                                   
OL,6,GEwen Ferguson believes he is capable   
OL,7,Gof competing for a place on the PGA    
OL,8,GTour and has set his sights on bigger  
OL,9,Gachievements in 2027 after putting an  
OL,10,Ginjury-hit spell behind him.           
OL,12,FThe three-time DP World Tour winner    
OL,13,Fsays improved fitness, greater         
OL,14,Fstrength and a more consistent scoring 
OL,15,Fgame have provided encouragement       
OL,16,Fbefore this week's season finale in    
OL,17,FDubai.                                 
